  "notes": [
    "node_role is 'all' here so a single-machine install works as copied: 'all' runs on any node. A two-node estate sets 'master' or 'worker' per command and declares each node's role with the DB_OPS_NODE_ROLE environment variable - it is deliberately not in config.json, so a config copied between nodes cannot mislabel one."
  ]
